{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "script_id": "demo",
      "number": 1,
      "int_ext": "EXT",
      "location": "HIGHWAY 9 - MOJAVE DESERT",
      "time_of_day": "DAWN",
      "heading": "EXT. HIGHWAY 9 - MOJAVE DESERT - DAWN",
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 2,
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e001-4000-8000-000000000101",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
          "seq": 1,
          "type": "scene_heading",
          "character": null,
          "page": 1,
          "text": "EXT. HIGHWAY 9 - MOJAVE DESERT - DAWN"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e002-4000-8000-000000000101",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
          "seq": 2,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 1,
          "text": "A two-lane road cuts through cracked earth. Heat shimmer already rising at the horizon. A battered 1974 FORD BRONCO rolls into frame, windows down, trailing a thin plume of dust."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e003-4000-8000-000000000101",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
          "seq": 3,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 1,
          "text": "The radio crackles. PATSY CLINE bleeds through static. The driver's hand hangs out the window, fingers trailing in the warm air."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e004-4000-8000-000000000101",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
          "seq": 4,
          "type": "transition",
          "character": null,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "CUT TO:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "script_id": "demo",
      "number": 2,
      "int_ext": "INT",
      "location": "FORD BRONCO",
      "time_of_day": "CONTINUOUS",
      "heading": "INT. FORD BRONCO - CONTINUOUS",
      "page_start": 2,
      "page_end": 4,
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e001-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 1,
          "type": "scene_heading",
          "character": null,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "INT. FORD BRONCO - CONTINUOUS"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e002-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 2,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "NORA VASQUEZ (38, sunburned, a map unfolded across the steering wheel) squints at a hand-written address on a gas-station receipt. The Patsy Cline cuts out. She reaches forward and thumps the dash."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e003-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 3,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 2,
          "text": "NORA"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e004-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 4,
          "type": "parenthetical",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 2,
          "text": "(to herself)"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e005-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 2,
          "text": "Come on. Not now."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e006-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 6,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 3,
          "text": "The radio crackles back to life — this time it's WILLIE NELSON, \"ON THE ROAD AGAIN.\" She laughs despite herself."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e007-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 7,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 3,
          "text": "NORA"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e008-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 3,
          "text": "Alright, Willie. You win. We keep going."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e009-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 9,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 3,
          "text": "She drops the receipt in the cupholder and fixes both hands on the wheel. The Bronco accelerates."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e010-4000-8000-000000000202",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
          "seq": 10,
          "type": "transition",
          "character": null,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "SMASH CUT TO:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "script_id": "demo",
      "number": 3,
      "int_ext": "INT",
      "location": "DINER",
      "time_of_day": "NIGHT",
      "heading": "INT. DINER - NIGHT",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7,
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e001-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 1,
          "type": "scene_heading",
          "character": null,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "INT. DINER - NIGHT"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e002-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 2,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "Vinyl booths under fluorescent light. A Wurlitzer jukebox glows in the corner. SARAH drops a coin in the slot. \"TAKE ON ME\" by A-HA fills the room. MARCUS (40s, weathered) watches from the counter, nursing a COCA-COLA."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e003-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 3,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 4,
          "text": "SARAH"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e004-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 4,
          "text": "God, I haven't heard this since high school."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e005-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 5,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 5,
          "text": "MARCUS"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e006-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 6,
          "type": "parenthetical",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 5,
          "text": "(not looking up)"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e007-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 5,
          "text": "Nineteen eighty-five. That song's older than half the people in this room."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e008-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 8,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 5,
          "text": "SARAH"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e009-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 9,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 5,
          "text": "Then those people missed out. Sit down, Marcus. That stool's been saving itself for you."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e010-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 10,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "Marcus sets down the Coca-Cola. Something in him relents. He crosses to her booth and slides in across from her. The jukebox cycles to a PATSY CLINE track."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e011-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 11,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 6,
          "text": "MARCUS"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e012-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 12,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 6,
          "text": "You know, there's something I've been meaning to tell you. Something I should have said a long time ago. Back when we were still at the — back before all of this. Before the road and the desert and whatever it is we're doing out here."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e013-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 13,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 7,
          "text": "MARCUS (CONT'D)"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e014-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 14,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 7,
          "text": "I never stopped looking for you."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e015-4000-8000-000000000303",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "seq": 15,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 7,
          "text": "A long silence. The Patsy Cline swells."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "script_id": "demo",
      "number": 4,
      "int_ext": "INT/EXT",
      "location": "NORA'S BRONCO / HIGHWAY 9",
      "time_of_day": "LATER",
      "heading": "INT./EXT. NORA'S BRONCO / HIGHWAY 9 - LATER",
      "page_start": 8,
      "page_end": 9,
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e001-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 1,
          "type": "scene_heading",
          "character": null,
          "page": 8,
          "text": "INT./EXT. NORA'S BRONCO / HIGHWAY 9 - LATER"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e002-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 2,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 8,
          "text": "The Bronco is parked on a dirt shoulder. Nora sits half-in, half-out of the open driver's door, feet on the ground, phone pressed to her ear. A TRUCK thunders past, rocking the vehicle."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e003-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 3,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 8,
          "text": "NORA"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e004-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 4,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 8,
          "text": "I'm almost there. Two hours, maybe less if I push it. Just — don't let him leave before I get there."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e005-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 5,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 8,
          "text": "She listens. Her jaw tightens."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e006-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 6,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 9,
          "text": "NORA"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e007-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 7,
          "type": "parenthetical",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 9,
          "text": "(quietly)"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e008-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 8,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 9,
          "text": "I know what I'm walking into. I've known since Flagstaff."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e009-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 9,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 9,
          "text": "She ends the call. Sits still for a moment. Then gets back in the Bronco and pulls the door shut."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e010-4000-8000-000000000404",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
          "seq": 10,
          "type": "transition",
          "character": null,
          "page": 9,
          "text": "CUT TO:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "script_id": "demo",
      "number": 5,
      "int_ext": "EXT",
      "location": "ABANDONED MOTEL - PARKING LOT",
      "time_of_day": "NIGHT",
      "heading": "EXT. ABANDONED MOTEL - PARKING LOT - NIGHT",
      "page_start": 10,
      "page_end": 12,
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e001-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 1,
          "type": "scene_heading",
          "character": null,
          "page": 10,
          "text": "EXT. ABANDONED MOTEL - PARKING LOT - NIGHT"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e002-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 2,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 10,
          "text": "The neon SUNSET PALMS MOTEL sign buzzes and flickers — the P and the S burnt out, leaving UNSET ALM. The Bronco rolls to a stop. Nora steps out."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e003-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 3,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 10,
          "text": "Marcus is already there, leaning against a rusted ice machine. Sarah stands a few feet away, arms crossed. Nobody looks happy to be here."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e004-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 4,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "MARCUS"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e005-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 5,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "MARCUS",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "You're late."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e006-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 6,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "NORA"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e007-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 7,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "Traffic."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e008-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 8,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "SARAH"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e009-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 9,
          "type": "parenthetical",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "(gesturing at the empty highway)"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e010-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 10,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "SARAH",
          "page": 11,
          "text": "On what road, exactly?"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e011-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 11,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 12,
          "text": "Nora looks at the motel. Then at Marcus. Then at the road she came in on. She exhales slowly."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e012-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 12,
          "type": "character",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 12,
          "text": "NORA"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e013-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 13,
          "type": "dialogue",
          "character": "NORA",
          "page": 12,
          "text": "Alright. Tell me what you know. All of it — no more half-truths on a gas-station receipt."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e014-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 14,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 12,
          "text": "Marcus pushes off the ice machine. He reaches into his jacket and produces a MANILA ENVELOPE, its seal already broken. He holds it out."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e015-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 15,
          "type": "action",
          "character": null,
          "page": 12,
          "text": "Nora takes it. Opens it. Reads. Her expression doesn't change, but her hand tightens on the paper."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e016-4000-8000-000000000505",
          "scene_id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
          "seq": 16,
          "type": "transition",
          "character": null,
          "page": 12,
          "text": "FADE OUT."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
